Methodological framework drafted (from parallel analysis session): three structural phenomena
explaining funding data gaps beyond simple "opacity":
  1. Institutional Budget Pooling — state channels macro-grants to GmbH intermediaries
     (Koproduktionshaus Wien GmbH / brut, Szene Wien GmbH), making individual colectivo
     funding invisible in Beschluss records.
  2. Identity/Legal Entity Dissociation — digital portals index legal names, not artistic
     brands. "rhiz" as brand ≠ "Rantasa + Rantasa GmbH" as legal entity.
  3. Micro-Funding Fragmentation — Bezirkskulturförderung (typically 300–5000 EUR per
     event) does not appear in federal or central MA7 transparency instruments.
 
These three phenomena to be incorporated into the Methodenkapitel of the Bericht as
explanation for structural data limits rather than citing "opacidad" generically.
 
